<title>BELGIUM: Greece to raise Turkish foot and mouth outbreak.</title>
<headline>Greece to raise Turkish foot and mouth outbreak.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece is asking European Union farm ministers to discuss the question of foot and mouth outbreaks in Turkey when they meet in Luxembourg next week, a British official said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Greeks have controls because of foot and mouth which originated in Turkey and they are concerned. They want a discussion,&quot; the official said.</p>
</text>
